1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,999
I'm a junior at Kaiyo University,
Kujo Hiroto.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,100
You remind me a bit of Okumi-san, Kujo.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,260
Don't look at me like that.
You're making me nervous.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,300
Just be a good boy and accept my love.

5
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:24,140
I've never been the one to take the lead.
Don't be disappointed if I suck at it.

6
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:27,100
Not at all.

7
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:29,299
Wait, is this your first time?

8
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,020
Shut up. Yeah, it is.

9
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,260
It's my first time ever.

10
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:36,180
Hizaki-san and Hideaki.

11
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,600
Here, say ah.

12
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,060
Ah...

13
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:42,620
Ah.

14
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:58,060
Good work.

15
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:02,990
- Good work.
- Are you seeing anyone?

16
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:04,500
Huh?

17
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:08,160
I guess you could say
there's someone I like.

18
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:11,019
Until you get tired of me,

19
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:12,760
I won't date anyone else.

20
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,060
Ai-chan.

21
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:19,880
I see.

22
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:21,720
What a shame.

23
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,580
If you ever change your mind, let me know.

24
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,680
Yeah.

25
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:30,280
You guys even talk the same way.

26
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:52,000
(Health Checkup Result:
Re-examination Required)

27
00:01:58,260 --> 00:01:59,260
Who is it?

28
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,560
Hey.

29
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,760
Hiroto.

30
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:16,330
"Are the Sexy Buttocks Not Good?"

31
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,900
(Episode 7)

32
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:22,340
Here, this is from Mom.

33
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,840
Thanks.

34
00:02:29,100 --> 00:02:30,180
Huh?

35
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,780
Don't just snoop around.

36
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:36,600
You're not getting any younger.

37
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,299
You know what I mean, right?

38
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:40,836
If you drag it out too long,
it's the people around you who suffer.

39
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:42,420
Don't scare me.

40
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,160
Never mind me.
How's your internship going?

41
00:02:46,860 --> 00:02:50,120
Everyone's been really nice and friendly.

42
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,800
Especially Hizaki-san.

43
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:59,720
He's super cute, isn't he?

44
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:02,200
Huh?

45
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:03,500
What about Hizaki?

46
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,560
Although nothing has happened yet,

47
00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:08,540
Yet?

48
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:12,340
I got lost on the floor on my first day.

49
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:14,520
And I happened to walk
in on Hizaki-san changing.

50
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:17,880
Excuse me, where is the
General Affairs Department?

51
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:24,980
Wait!

52
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:28,020
You saw him changing?

53
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:29,720
Yeah.

54
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,880
The way he tried to cover up was so cute.

55
00:03:35,660 --> 00:03:36,900
I haven't told him,

56
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:40,139
but I think it was love at first sight.

57
00:03:40,140 --> 00:03:41,520
Wait, hold on a second.

58
00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:44,520
Hiroto, that's not right.
Don't you have a girlfriend?

59
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:46,040
We broke up.

60
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,660
Besides, I swing both ways.

61
00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:54,100
I saw two people the other day.

62
00:03:54,980 --> 00:03:58,620
Hideaki and Hizaki-san
walking together early in the morning.

63
00:04:09,380 --> 00:04:11,520
I figured I should give you a heads-up.

64
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,640
Even though he said he likes someone,

65
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:17,880
is it okay if I go after him?

66
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:23,080
If you're just playing around
and end up hurting Ai-chan,

67
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:26,000
I'll be seriously pissed.

68
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:30,000
I'm dead serious.

69
00:04:38,660 --> 00:04:41,460
(I haven't been able to
see Okumi-san lately.)

70
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:45,120
(Is the peak season always this busy?)

71
00:04:46,940 --> 00:04:50,500
(If I tell him I want to see him,
he'll definitely push himself too hard.)

72
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:54,340
Hizaki, got a minute?

73
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,440
Good work.

74
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:58,139
If you're looking for Uchida-san,
he's still here.

75
00:04:58,140 --> 00:04:59,760
No, I'm here for you.

76
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:01,120
Me?

77
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:08,360
A middle-aged man with withdrawal symptoms
will be coming to see you shortly.

78
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:10,540
Sorry to ask,
but could you persuade him to go home?

79
00:05:11,910 --> 00:05:12,980
Sure.

80
00:05:24,750 --> 00:05:26,520
Sorry for dropping by so late.

81
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:31,460
Please, just let me sit
here for ten minutes.

82
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:34,840
Don't make it sound
like you're sniffing a cat.

83
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,720
You're actually sniffing me.

84
00:05:44,060 --> 00:05:45,060
Listen,

85
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,400
I'm really happy you came to see me,

86
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:52,660
but if you're busy, wouldn't it be
better to come after you're done?

87
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:54,960
Ai-chan.

88
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,800
I...

89
00:05:57,500 --> 00:06:01,140
I've developed a condition where I can't
function without my regular dose of Ai-chan.

90
00:06:02,340 --> 00:06:04,260
Don't say things like
that with a straight face.

91
00:06:24,690 --> 00:06:25,690
Wait a minute.

92
00:06:27,130 --> 00:06:28,580
Can't I?

93
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,720
No.

94
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:32,190
I can't?

95
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:35,670
Duh, of course not.

96
00:06:40,290 --> 00:06:42,410
Goto, that guy...
Exactly ten minutes and he...

97
00:06:42,610 --> 00:06:44,069
Alright, you should head back.

98
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,590
- Just five more minutes?
- No.

99
00:06:45,930 --> 00:06:47,870
Don't cause trouble for Goto-san.

100
00:06:50,990 --> 00:06:51,990
Um...

101
00:06:52,930 --> 00:06:54,030
What is it?

102
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:57,490
I'll come again.

103
00:07:01,110 --> 00:07:04,010
(Was he trying to say something just now?)

104
00:07:07,370 --> 00:07:09,630
(I want to be with you too.)

105
00:07:10,270 --> 00:07:11,510
(I want to, but...)

106
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,400
(Health Checkup Result:
Re-examination Required)

107
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:44,070
(Okumi-san is the president.)

108
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:50,530
(He has to work hard for his employees.)

109
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:56,009
Good work.

110
00:07:56,010 --> 00:07:57,849
- Good work.
- Good work.

111
00:07:57,850 --> 00:07:59,310
Good work.

112
00:07:59,410 --> 00:08:01,349
(Is he eating properly?)

113
00:08:01,350 --> 00:08:02,350
(Okumi-san.)

114
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:07,250
(It feels like it's been forever
since we were last together.)

115
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:10,070
Ai-chan.

116
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:14,310
Ai-chan.

117
00:08:15,210 --> 00:08:16,330
Hang in there.

118
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:19,510
I...

119
00:08:20,230 --> 00:08:23,590
I've developed a condition where I can't
function without my regular dose of Ai-chan.

120
00:08:30,330 --> 00:08:31,410
Hizaki-san.

121
00:08:34,410 --> 00:08:38,510
Hizaki-san, it's getting late.
Are you not heading home yet?

122
00:08:43,050 --> 00:08:44,970
If you still have work,
let me help you out.

123
00:08:48,310 --> 00:08:49,310
Ah.

124
00:08:49,490 --> 00:08:50,490
Thank you.
I'm almost done.

125
00:08:52,210 --> 00:08:55,750
(For a second, I mistook Kujo
for Okumi-san.)

126
00:09:00,090 --> 00:09:01,229
What's wrong?

127
00:09:01,230 --> 00:09:02,330
I'm fine.

128
00:09:03,550 --> 00:09:04,650
Fine?

129
00:09:08,450 --> 00:09:10,310
Then why are you crying?

130
00:09:12,710 --> 00:09:13,710
Huh?

131
00:09:13,950 --> 00:09:15,110
It's probably just allergies.

132
00:09:17,470 --> 00:09:18,970
Why are you crying?

133
00:09:20,550 --> 00:09:21,950
I'm here if you want to talk.

134
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:24,790
It's really nothing.

135
00:09:26,750 --> 00:09:30,150
Is it because of my uncle?

136
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:55,590
If it were me,
I'd never make you cry.

137
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:12,510
Don't... make jokes like that.

138
00:10:13,950 --> 00:10:15,230
I'm not joking.

139
00:10:21,130 --> 00:10:24,050
After all, it was love
at first sight for me.

140
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:29,470
So don't say the same things
as Okumi-san.

141
00:10:31,290 --> 00:10:32,330
The same?

142
00:10:34,530 --> 00:10:35,630
Well, that's annoying.

143
00:10:40,850 --> 00:10:41,850
Sorry.

144
00:10:41,990 --> 00:10:44,150
I'm always showing you
such an embarrassing side of me.

145
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:48,210
Not at all. I could never get tired
of seeing you all flustered.

146
00:10:49,210 --> 00:10:51,710
(That's exactly how you two are alike.)

147
00:10:53,270 --> 00:10:54,570
But I'm being serious.

148
00:10:56,170 --> 00:10:58,190
In that case,
I'll give you a serious answer.

149
00:10:59,830 --> 00:11:00,830
I'm sorry.

150
00:11:01,330 --> 00:11:03,070
My heart belongs entirely to Okumi-san.

151
00:11:05,050 --> 00:11:07,070
Is there not even a millimeter
of room for me?

152
00:11:08,070 --> 00:11:09,130
None.

153
00:11:13,590 --> 00:11:14,590
I guess not.

154
00:11:15,500 --> 00:11:16,590
Yeah.

155
00:11:18,790 --> 00:11:21,166
I didn't want to tell you this
because it frustrates me, but...

156
00:11:21,190 --> 00:11:23,630
Hideaki collapsed from overwork.

157
00:11:24,030 --> 00:11:25,530
Huh? When did that happen?

158
00:11:27,030 --> 00:11:30,670
I heard yesterday
that he was taken to the hospital.

159
00:11:31,210 --> 00:11:33,210
So it must have been
before then at least.

160
00:11:34,110 --> 00:11:35,190
Is he okay?

161
00:11:35,890 --> 00:11:37,590
He said it's nothing serious.

162
00:11:38,690 --> 00:11:40,010
He should be resting at home now.

163
00:11:43,470 --> 00:11:46,670
Seriously,
he should have just gotten checked out.

164
00:11:48,070 --> 00:11:49,170
Checked out for what?

165
00:11:52,890 --> 00:11:58,610
Actually, Hideaki's checkup had some red flags,
and he was supposed to get a re-examination.

166
00:12:13,700 --> 00:12:14,700
What's wrong?

167
00:12:14,770 --> 00:12:16,010
You look terrifying.

168
00:12:17,130 --> 00:12:18,230
Are you kidding me?

169
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:21,430
Overwork?
Re-examination?

170
00:12:23,110 --> 00:12:26,790
Could you at least consider my feelings?! I had
to hear from someone else that you were sick!

171
00:13:12,890 --> 00:13:14,820
(Next Episode Preview)
It has that Ai-chan flavour.

172
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:19,030
Please cherish yourself
as much as you cherish me.

173
00:13:19,450 --> 00:13:22,290
Then I'll gladly help myself to dessert.

174
00:13:22,690 --> 00:13:24,690
Hideaki, you're too slow.

175
00:13:25,310 --> 00:13:26,310
Who are you?
